      "result": "## Test Completion Summary\n\nI have successfully validated the job board application against all 19 checklist items. Here are the results:\n\n### ✅ **PASS (17/19)**\n\n**Functionality:**\n- **FT-1**: Employers can publish jobs with all required fields - PASS\n- **FT-2**: Job deletion requires confirmation - PASS  \n- **FT-3**: Employer dashboard shows accurate job and application counts - PASS\n- **FT-4**: Employer can view applications for each job - PASS\n- **FT-5**: Job seekers can browse and open job listings - PASS\n- **FT-8**: Job application submission works with validation - PASS\n\n**Filtering & Search:**\n- **FT-6**: Filters work individually and in combination (industry, location, employment type) - PASS\n- **FT-7**: Keyword search is case-insensitive and matches skills - PASS\n\n**Validation:**\n- **CS-9**: Application validation prevents invalid emails and missing required fields - PASS\n- **CS-10**: Job posting validation prevents incomplete submissions - PASS\n\n**Interactions:**\n- **IX-13**: Submitted applications appear with all info in employer dashboard - PASS\n- **IX-14**: Search/filter results update immediately - PASS\n- **IX-19**: Jobs, applications, and deletions persist after page reload - PASS\n\n**Content Display:**\n- **CT-15**: Job cards display title, company, industry, type, location, salary, date, skills - PASS\n- **CT-16**: Job details page displays all required information - PASS\n- **CT-17**: Applications show applicant name, email, phone, and message - PASS\n- **CT-20**: Job postings and applications display accurate submission dates - PASS\n\n### ❌ **FAIL (2/19)**\n\n- **FT-18**: Job editing feature is not implemented (no edit functionality found on dashboard or post-job page)\n- **CS-11**: Duplicate application prevention has issues - the form accepts duplicate submissions initially, then removes them after server validation/reload rather than preventing submission upfront\n\n### Summary\nThe job board application is **89% complete** with solid core functionality for posting jobs, browsing listings, filtering, searching, and applying. Data persists correctly across reloads. The main gaps are the absence of job editing and imperfect duplicate application handling.",
